Each year, we learn a whole lot more about how the brain works. In the future, maybe we will have helmets that we can wear at work. They'll allow us to be more focused or juggle multiple demands. There's nothing wrong with trying to get the most out of our brains, any more than there's something wrong and trying to get the most out of our legs or our hands. If there are machines that can help us lift heavier things than we ever thought possible, and machines that can help us move faster than we ever imagined,
每年，我们对大脑工作原理的了解都在增加。在未来，也许我们会拥有可以在工作中佩戴的头盔。它们将使我们能够更加专注或应对多种需求。试图充分利用我们的大脑并没有什么错，就像试图充分利用我们的腿或手没有什么错一样。如果有机器可以帮助我们举起比我们想象的更重的物体，以及帮助我们以比我们想象的更快的速度移动的机器，

